bt-cataphract-demand-goal 1) (or (goal bt-bombard-cannon-demand-goal 1) (or (goal bt-resource-mode-goal bt-resource-mode-imperial-bank) (or (goal bt-resource-mode-goal bt-resource-mode-imperial-bank-prep) (or (goal bt-resource-mode-goal
